  "title": "Celebrating Black History Month: Gabby Stinnett",
  "summary": "Knowing your worth and celebrating your identity as a Black woman is a challenge when having to confront racial prejudice on the job. Treasury Prime Bank Program Manager Gabby Stinnett has worked in the banking industry for close to a decade and shares how she realized she didn’t have to prove anything to anyone, and how she celebrates being Black every day.",
